02:02:35.400 --> 02:02:42.280
a non-alcoholic lager top will you and a special for me listen if i can just get raquel and tony

02:02:42.280 --> 02:02:51.480
together i'll be on a right winner now she's pregnant only just a little bit you're just

02:02:51.480 --> 02:02:58.040
exploiting her ain't you no oh contraire rodney oh contraire she's going to be earning out of this

02:02:58.040 --> 02:02:59.480
and earning well

