Tomorrow night.

02:08:52.140 --> 02:08:53.140
What?

02:08:53.140 --> 02:08:54.140
It's all right, it's all right.

02:08:54.140 --> 02:08:58.670
I know that you and Raquel have got an awful lot of work to do, rehearsing and, you know,

02:08:58.670 --> 02:09:00.000
